  "comment": "VLAN Sub-Interfaces (802.1Q) 802.1Q VLAN interfaces are represented as virtual sub-interfaces in VyOS. The term used for this is vif. Configuration of a tagged sub-interface is accomplished using the configuration command set interfaces ethernet  vif . set interfaces ethernet eth1 vif 100 description 'VLAN 100' set interfaces ethernet eth1 vif 100 address '192.168.100.1/24' VLAN",
